      "notes": "CGWB Ground Water Year Book of Tamil Nadu and U.T. of Puducherry - backs 21 Madurai dug wells with 2023/2024/2025 readings. HONEST LIMIT: this is CGWB's Tamil Nadu regional page, NOT a Year Book listing - no such listing exists anywhere. Verified 2026-07-26: the cgwbpnm search UI 404s (search?type=2&cat_id=4&state_id=33...), old_website/GW-Year-Book-State.html is gone, and gwdata.cgwb.gov.in is a JS app with no hrefs. Individual documents ARE retrievable at cgwb.gov.in/cgwbpnm/public/uploads/documents/<opaque-id>file.pdf but the ids are not guessable. /node/903 is the only watchable CGWB TN surface found: it carries dated uploads under /sites/default/files/<YYYY-MM>/, though today those are district aquifer maps rather than the Year Book. Treat a detection here as 'CGWB TN published something', then check by hand. CITATION WARNING: the 2024-25 source_url previously recorded in madurai-cgwb-stations.json resolved 200 but served the 2017-2018 edition - see that file's _citation_audit. Both TN editions are OPEN TRACES. This family is the platform's highest-value unwatched source and deserves the url-template method or a browser-session fetch. TLS: cgwb.gov.in serves an INCOMPLETE CERT CHAIN - Node fetch fails with UNABLE_TO_VERIFY_LEAF_SIGNATURE while curl succeeds (its CA bundle is broader). insecureTLS is required here; discovered when the first --accept errored 'fetch failed' on 2026-07-26. LISTING FOUND 2026-07-26 (corrects an earlier note in this entry): cgwb.gov.in/cgwbpnm/ IS a browsable publication warehouse - 171 download/<id> links with titles, dates and a state filter - so a Year Book listing DOES exist and this entry now watches it. A new edition appears as a new download id. RETRIEVAL IS BROKEN THOUGH: every download/<id>, publication-detail/<id> and thumbnail-derived path returns 404, including ids CGWB itself links (verified on 2015/2016/2023 with and without a referer). Only the opaque public/uploads/documents/<id>file.pdf form works, and those ids are not exposed in the listing.  CONFIRMED PRESENT: 'Groundwater Year Book, Tamilnadu UT of Puducherry (2024 - 2025)', posted 25 Mar 2026, publication id 2023. RETRIEVAL IS BROKEN AT CGWB'S END - established 2026-07-26, do not repeat this. The publications warehouse at cgwb.gov.in/cgwbpnm/ LISTS both 2024-25 Year Books with titles, posting dates and publication ids, but there is no working public route to the PDFs. Eight automated routes were tried and all return the same 33 KB Drupal 404 ('paged nahin mila', plain openresty HTTP/2 404 - no WAF, no captcha, no challenge): download/<id>; publication-detail/<id>; the CSRF POST to publication/<id> followed by the download, replicating the site's own downloadPdf() JS; a cookie-jar session; deriving the path from the thumbnail id; a directory listing on uploads/documents/; search engines (not indexed); and the retired /Regions/<REGION>/Reports/ path. CONFIRMED IN A REAL BROWSER by the maintainer the same day: the page renders and the publications are visible, but the download does not work there either. So this is NOT a bot block, NOT a session problem and NOT something a browser fetch solves - an earlier version of this note said 'fetch it from a browser session', which was wrong. Only /cgwbpnm/ itself and /cgwbpnm/public/* static assets serve; every other route under /cgwbpnm/ 404s, which looks like a reverse-proxy misconfiguration on their side. The id scheme is <unix-seconds><random>, verified three ways (1688105823 = 30 Jun 2023 matches the 2017-18 PDF's own creation timestamp; 1774431953 and 1774326882 match the two 2026 posting dates), but the thumbnail and the PDF get DIFFERENT random suffixes, so the path cannot be derived from anything the listing exposes. NEXT STEPS, in order: (1) the cgwb-yearbook-* registry entries watch the download/<id> link set, so a re-upload or a route fix changes the set and we get told; (2) failing that, email CGWB SECR Chennai / CR Nagpur, or RTI. Not an engineering problem.",
